 oto Imperial Palace\nNijo Castle: very original castle\nMaruyama Park\, be
 hind Yasaka Shrine: where the Gion tour finishes\nKamigamo Shrine: about 5
 0 min by train\nPhilosopher's Path: about 30 min by bus\nSilver Pavilion (
