 od market\nInternational Manga Museum\nSamurai and Ninja Museum\nHigashiya
 ma temple with the giant Buddha\nBee's Knees cocktail bar\nIn the Moon roo
 ftop bar: opens 17:30 to 18:00\nRound One: big arcade and bowling
